
> codex-hud@0.1.0 test:visual
> npm run build:test && node --test dist-test/tests/unit/visual-baselines.test.js


> codex-hud@0.1.0 build:test
> node ./node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc -p tsconfig.test.json

✔ visual semantics: all presets retain identity and exact frame dimensions (182.401353ms)
✔ visual semantics: child role counts off removes only footer counts, not children, summaries or targets (4.891469ms)
✔ visual semantics: recap viewport is independent of card preset at every width and look (119.034213ms)
✔ visual semantics: active Settings navigation retains full localized label and nonoverlapping controls from width 24 (24.938141ms)
✔ visual semantics: Save returns the new width and the next render reflows navigation, values and selected identity (27.915333ms)
✔ visual semantics: confirmation owns input, blocks hidden UI clicks and defaults to cancel (7.45884ms)
✔ visual semantics: Inspector preserves stored summary and distinguishes explicit Coverage from legacy Recorded (14.268886ms)
✔ visual semantics: normalization retains spaces and diffs identify the exact case and row (0.39859ms)
✔ visual semantics: fixture generation is deterministic without reading a wall clock (350.054601ms)
